# Rockfall-net post (decorative, NON-solid, like jetty_post; M3 round 2):
# the netz end tile's 4 px steel post k|i|m|k (columns 6-9) with a d clamp
# every 8 px, stacked under a netz end down to the ground. Vertical autotile
# only: an open bottom gets a k-outlined i/m/d concrete footing; left/right
# bits are ignored.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_netz_post
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
